"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, dredge.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The preloaded DREDGE Mod Loader folder will then be downloaded into the game's core folder.",
